{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1481.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"346e5e60b1a2f4fbed62ce3bb01d1ad6a931df656f0cb00a119001dbec989f00","ja":"バラエティ番組のリハーサル中……","zh":"综艺节目的彩排中……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1481.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"4a6a6c1f66d8c5d9aea6ce65ec8f9acb9c801032dae3589cfa70769b81b600a3","ja":"「本日の特別企画はこちら！\n『アイドル映えタンデム選手権』～！」","zh":"「今天的特别企划是这个！\n『最上镜偶像摩托双人骑大赛』～！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1481.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"63133042dd24d5a38b2d77adcc87ab1fc230bfeb7ac60e21bba2fb5dd7292a50","ja":"「タンデムでの運転の正確さと、\n運転姿の美しさを競っていただきます！」","zh":"“大家将比拼双人骑行时的驾驶精准度，\n以及驾驶身姿的优美程度！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1481.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"145557f49a9a2e19f764ed71fbb63e6592c5bcd75d387dce8f1490fd878beef9","ja":"のり子さん、今日はよろしく頼みます。\nあたし、しっかりつかまってるからねぇ。","zh":"法子小姐，今天就拜托你啦。\n我会好好抓牢的哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1481.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"c4e1d0376943792e56a066b8b2c9916dd74ecd9b79d683700790f0269cd98779","ja":"こちらこそ！　翼と紬も、どうすれば\n見栄えがよくなるか、アドバイスお願いね！","zh":"我才要谢谢你们！翼和紬也请帮我出出主意，\n怎样才能看起来更好看呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1481.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"86cb92a6a49cf0002a3850b6b18e080c226ff96ba889c2a0d6f66c65fe580507","ja":"まかせてくださ～い！　アドバイザー兼応援団として、\nしっかりサポートしま～す！","zh":"就交给我吧～！作为顾问兼后援团，\n我会好好支持大家的～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1481.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"131a810a85ccdf8fc8a528b467e9ea56bb2015de12632b91df29cc0e6eaa7cf3","ja":"リハーサルでのスタッフさん達の反応も、\n立派な参考材料になりますから……。","zh":"工作人员们在彩排时的反应，\n也是非常好的参考资料呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1481.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"17d010839915ffc8967f9a212e1e077904f669b1a963375e07f7448f5d695499","ja":"その評価を元に、本番でどのような\nパフォーマンスをするか、考えていきましょう。","zh":"根据那项评价，来思考一下\n正式演出时要带来怎样的表演吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1481.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"399a71f14e07a20df7dcae1f56819332a3fb881239237a1904c63e59ffc74148","ja":"「では、さっそく事前試走を行いますので、\n先ほど提示した番号順に、コースへ向かってください」","zh":"“那么，马上开始赛前试跑，\n请大家按照刚才出示的号码顺序前往赛道”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1481.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"0bcc486919cae716a7f2fe794cd8d58a0d9f7f27d1297dc243a56a607d4e29db","ja":"そろそろアタシたちの番だね。\nひなた、それじゃあいこっか。","zh":"差不多轮到我们了呢。\n日向，那我们走吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1481.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"315d750570cf860c546c4055c780c7dd609dd2b725406342da8c81fea61d96cd","ja":"うん……なんだか、ドキドキしてきたよぉ……。","zh":"嗯……总觉得，开始心跳加速了呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1481.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"30af8035317d2ebf91699b885d5d1c5c4a2ac3140f969d5e587d560a975d0e76","ja":"大丈夫、すぐリラックスさせてあげるから♪\nそれじゃ、レッツゴー！","zh":"没问题，马上就让你放松下来♪\n那么，出发咯！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
